---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout
  title="Bridge Coach | Richard Ritmeijer – World Bridge Champion"
  description="Richard Ritmeijer — world bridge champion and bridge teacher for 25 years — offers expert coaching at the highest level and hires out as a professional bridge partner at tournaments."
  active="home"
>
  <div class="hero">
    <div class="hero-inner">
      <h1>You've played bridge for years.<br />But you know there's more in you.</h1>
      <p class="hero-what">For players who want to be <strong>coached at the top level</strong> — or who want to <strong>hire me as their partner</strong> and receive coaching along the way.</p>
      <div class="hero-credential">
        <strong>Richard Ritmeijer</strong> &nbsp;·&nbsp; World Bridge Champion &nbsp;·&nbsp; Champions Cup winner &nbsp;·&nbsp; 25 years of bridge teaching
      </div>
      <div class="hero-actions">
        <a class="btn-gold" href="/coaching/#proposal">Book a free intake call →</a>
        <span class="hero-subaction">No obligation · no sales pitch, just a conversation</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="section">

    <h2>What you'll find at Bridge Performance</h2>
    <div class="two-col-grid">
      <div class="pillar-card">
        <h3>Expert coaching — ★★★★ / ★★★★★</h3>
        <p>Personal coaching for the expert and world-class player. One-on-one, as a partnership, or in a small group. Online or in person. Price on request.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="pillar-card">
        <h3>Hire a professional partner</h3>
        <p>I play alongside you at a tournament — online, in the Netherlands, or abroad. Coaching included. Price on request.</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="cross-ref">
      <span class="cross-ref-icon">🎓</span>
      <span>
        <strong>Looking for courses, learning tracks, weekly training, themed lessons or clinics?</strong>
        Head to <a href="https://bridgeacademie.nl">Bridge Academie</a> — from your first steps to world class. This site is for players who want to be coached at the top level, and for those who want to hire me as a paid partner and receive coaching along the way.
      </span>
    </div>

    <div class="plateau-box">
      <p>You enjoy the game. You play regularly, and you know what you're doing. But somewhere, you also know there's more in you.</p>
      <p>That feeling isn't a coincidence. It's the moment where deliberate learning makes the difference. That's exactly where I come in.</p>
    </div>

    <hr />

    <h2>Who is this for?</h2>
    <p>This site is for players and clubs seeking the highest level: expert coaching at ★★★★/★★★★★ level, or an experienced professional to hire for a tournament.</p>

    <blockquote>
      "Bridge is a game of logic. Players who master the fundamentals and understand the general principles perform better, and more consistently. My lessons are about what actually works — simple, practical, and directly applicable."
    </blockquote>

    <div class="cta-block">
      <p><strong>Ready to take your game further?</strong></p>
      <a class="btn-gold" href="/coaching/#proposal">Book a free intake call →</a>
      <a class="btn-ghost" href="/about/">My story</a>
    </div>

  </div>
</Layout>
